#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:1
#: 95e5fa63d94b465b846b213a18563e5d
msgid "Operations and contribution"
msgstr "Operacion y contribucion"

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:3
#: ddfef596bbe04adca054b6181a3f4958
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Configuracion"

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:5
#: 2e2706017f9d4ddcbb19bf98a0062005
msgid ""
"Keep secrets outside documentation and source control. Use `.env.example` as"
" the public contract and store real values only in the designated local "
"settings surface."
msgstr ""
"Mantenga los secretos fuera de la documentacion y del control de codigo. Use"
" `.env.example` como contrato publico y guarde los valores reales solo en la"
" superficie local designada."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:7
#: d63c157927d34e02a8463a19205d3c79
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "Pruebas"

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:9
#: 5f6e8ef49f014987ae8e4aec302199e9
msgid ""
"Run the repository checks listed in the quickstart. A passing narrow test "
"does not prove unrelated interfaces or scientific claims."
msgstr ""
"Ejecute las comprobaciones del repositorio indicadas en el inicio rapido. "
"Una prueba acotada superada no demuestra interfaces no relacionadas ni "
"afirmaciones cientificas."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:11
#: f293c5d103b04b08a89615542d22dda4
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solucion de problemas"

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:13
#: 044c148c138e4318801f00178013b4b4
msgid "Confirm the repository and branch."
msgstr "Confirme el repositorio y la rama."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:14
#: bc3385710bdd4e8c93aa8970f151ecbf
msgid "Reproduce with the smallest supported input."
msgstr "Reproduzca con la entrada compatible mas pequena."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:15
#: e6377c1d8fe54a909b03feb1498ab7d5
msgid "Capture the exact command and error."
msgstr "Registre el comando y el error exactos."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:16
#: 79c5b31e99044695be808712c9420768
msgid "Check the documented runtime and lockfile."
msgstr "Compruebe el runtime documentado y el archivo de bloqueo."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:17
#: 85d931718f1346e0ad22f9c8374b6892
msgid "Open an issue with secret-free evidence."
msgstr "Abra una incidencia con evidencia sin secretos."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:19
#: 4b55b3359c7f41a296ab65455f2b2d0d
msgid "Security and privacy"
msgstr "Seguridad y privacidad"

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:21
#: 65aefa7087534a4a8c35c189d3dba82c
msgid ""
"Learning output is formative evidence. It is not a credential, assessment "
"authority, or autonomous teaching decision."
msgstr ""
"El resultado de aprendizaje es evidencia formativa. No es una credencial, "
"una autoridad evaluadora ni una decision docente autonoma."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:23
#: 1c51b73bb63a447d958bb51efa99450a
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Contribuir"

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:25
#: 8095d07f2ffe49bba5ac9396753bda5f
msgid ""
"Read `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md`, and the repository "
"license when present. Keep changes bounded and include the checks that "
"justify acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Lea `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `SAFETY.md` y la licencia del "
"repositorio cuando existan. Mantenga los cambios acotados e incluya las "
"comprobaciones que justifican su aceptacion."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:27
#: 8145a55790e5455d98739639a1fa823b
msgid "Releases"
msgstr "Versiones publicadas"

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:29
#: fddc44e98fad40e78fc52d3b580cc569
msgid ""
"The current public documentation describes `0.0.0` with status `public-"
"preview`. Consult the repository history and release notes for changes."
msgstr ""
"La documentacion publica actual describe `0.0.0` con el estado `public-"
"preview`. Consulte el historial del repositorio y las notas de version para "
"conocer los cambios."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/operations.md:31
#: ca9548fed8c7498fb85c24c3439fcd4c
msgid ""
"The Mage First-Proof mechanism is implemented and locally tested, but the "
"public preview must not be described as a live Builder-to-Colab service "
"until Auth0, the HTTPS broker, the unpacked extension, and a real Colab "
"callback pass acceptance together."
msgstr ""
"The Mage First-Proof mechanism is implemented and locally tested, but the "
"public preview must not be described as a live Builder-to-Colab service "
"until Auth0, the HTTPS broker, the unpacked extension, and a real Colab "
"callback pass acceptance together."
